[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="PatronLedger" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(330, -284)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Open the Ledger"
flag_to_set = "hollis_ledger_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]A second ledger[/b]

Not the Guild's books; those sit on the shelf with the Guild's crest. This one is plain calfskin, kept in the desk drawer that sticks.

Every patron who has ever asked Hollis Marrow for a quiet favour is in it: names, dates, sums, and what was asked. One set of initials recurs each season, [i]S.A.[/i], always beside the words [i]the valley venture[/i]. Another line repeats with no name at all: \"[i]Received by Ferrisford barge from the west. Sold on. Their share held.[/i]\"

It is not a record. It is insurance."
reexamine_text = "Every patron's favour, written down. Insurance."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/PatronLedger"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_170x50")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/PatronLedger"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Open the Ledger"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="ReceiptBoard" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-420, -60)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Receipts"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Warehouse receipts[/b]

Pinned in rows: barges unloaded at Riverside, each signed for by a Guild factor. Grain, timber, salt fish, wool.

The wool comes every fortnight from Ferrisford and goes into Warehouse Seven, which the factors' own notes call [i]the Guildmaster's store, no inspection[/i]. Thornhaven has no sheep worth the name."
reexamine_text = "Wool from a valley without sheep, into Warehouse Seven."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/ReceiptBoard"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_60x160")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/ReceiptBoard"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Read the Receipts"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="HouseDebts" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-300, 274)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Debt Book"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Debts of the great houses[/b]

An open book on a lectern, kept so the clerks can see it and remember who owes the Guild.

\"[i]House Ashdown: the late Lord's account. A hundred gold, at interest. Extended by the Guildmaster's grace, Midwinter last. Extended again.[/i]\"

The column for payments has a single entry, and it is not money. It reads: [i]See private ledger.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "House Ashdown owes a hundred gold. 'See private ledger.'"

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/HouseDebts"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_140x44")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/HouseDebts"]
